# Agent feeds a heredoc to bash through a pipeline that continues after the
# terminator line over more than one stage: lines keep joining while a stage
# ends in `|`, so bash runs the body (ADR-0037, ADR-0043, ADR-0049; critic
# finding on c96ce58)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "cat <<EOF |\nrm -rf xtask\nEOF\ntee /tmp/y |\nbash"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
